          "post_id": "533260",
          "text": "<p>Find the value of $$\\int_{-2}^{3}|x^3-3x^2-4x+12|dx$$</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$\\dfrac{125}{4}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$\\dfrac{131}{4}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$32$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$\\dfrac{119}{4}$</li></ol>",
