          "text": "<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"141\">Evaluate $$I=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sqrt{1+\\sin x}\\left(1+\\sqrt{1+\\sin x}\\right)}dx$$</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"263\">$2\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"263\">$\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"263\">$2\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"263\">$\\sqrt2-1$</li></ol>",
